# Env
# NOTE: .env is intentionally committed — it holds only the PUBLIC Supabase
# anon/publishable key, project id and URL, all of which ship inside the built
# JS bundle anyway (they are VITE_-prefixed). Lovable's hosted build reads it
# from the repo, so removing it breaks that deploy. Real secrets live in
# Supabase Edge Function secrets and are never in this repo — the
# secret-scan CI job enforces that.
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Supabase local
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
